      "These are starting points, not rankings. The same model can produce different results under different harnesses. A harness that [floods the model with irrelevant context](/daily-digest/load-only-the-tools-this-turn-needs) or stops without checking the result can make it worse. Model capability is not the same as task success.",
      "## 5. Where should you look to evaluate models?",
