      "- **Workflow requiring decisions and tool use:** consider an agent harness.",
      "- **Long-running or recurring workflow:** evaluate scheduling, persistent state, memory, monitoring, and recovery.",
      "- **High-risk workflow:** add permission boundaries, deterministic checks, auditability, and human approval.",
